# Vendored specification texts: reference material, not this project's code or prose. Marking them
# keeps GitHub's language statistics and its "N files changed" review view honest — a 400KB RFC is
# not a source file, and it never changes (see docs/rfc/README.md).
docs/rfc/*.txt linguist-vendored

# LF in every checkout, including Git for Windows (core.autocrlf=true): tests compare committed files
# byte-for-byte against generated output. Windows batch files keep the CRLF cmd.exe expects.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
